+ =C^*(L_a,R_b:a,b\in A_n)\subseteq B(L^2(A_n,\tau_n)).
+\]
+If every $\mathcal D_{\tau_n}(A_n)$ is finite, then
+Theorem~\ref{thm:kazhdan-transport} r